{"id":"n86476-1-7","stage":4,"title":"헐값 · 低价","scene":"工作与经济","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n86476-1-7-1","ko":"가구가 좋아 보이네요. 얼마에 샀어요?","zh":"家具看起来真不错啊。是花多少钱买的呢？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"가구가","meaning":"家具","explanation":"가구：家具；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"가구","audio":"/audio/7cd1a55d13c114f1190b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62492","senseId":"1","lemma":"가구","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"좋아","meaning":"好，美，优良，优美","explanation":"좋다：好，美，优良，优美；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"좋다","audio":"/audio/86d0464f1c6da40233cd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"79033","senseId":"1","lemma":"좋다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"보이네요.","meaning":"看起来，看上去","explanation":"보이다：看起来，看上去；네요：对新发现的情况表示感叹或确认，礼貌句末。","readings":[{"term":"보이다","audio":"/audio/da6f27438e6f345c1e87.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62091","senseId":"4","lemma":"보이다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"얼마에","meaning":"多少","explanation":"얼마：多少；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"얼마","audio":"/audio/8e0a4529e0c9d4ed9058.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29750","senseId":"1","lemma":"얼마","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"샀어요?","meaning":"买，购买","explanation":"사다：买，购买；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"사다","audio":"/audio/ee0ee072926e06fcb4a4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"49419","senseId":"1","lemma":"사다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"7cd1a55d13c114f1","term":"가구","zh":"家具","audio":"/audio/7cd1a55d13c114f1190b.mp3","entryId":"62492","definition":"家庭用的工具，如床、衣柜、餐桌等。","pronunciation":["가구"]},{"id":"86d0464f1c6da402","term":"좋다","zh":"好，美，优良，优美","audio":"/audio/86d0464f1c6da40233cd.mp3","entryId":"79033","definition":"性质或内容等很优秀，让人满意。","pronunciation":["조ː타"]},{"id":"da6f27438e6f345c","term":"보이다","zh":"看起来，看上去","audio":"/audio/da6f27438e6f345c1e87.mp3","entryId":"62091","definition":"认为或判断出某对象怎样。","pronunciation":["보이다"]},{"id":"8e0a4529e0c9d4ed","term":"얼마","zh":"多少","audio":"/audio/8e0a4529e0c9d4ed9058.mp3","entryId":"29750","definition":"不知道的数量、价值、程度。","pronunciation":["얼마"]},{"id":"ee0ee072926e06fc","term":"사다","zh":"买，购买","audio":"/audio/ee0ee072926e06fcb4a4.mp3","entryId":"49419","definition":"用钱使某种东西或权利为己所有。","pronunciation":["사다"]}],"audio":"/audio/9ff0bfc02f0e6251bc5e.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n86476-1-7-2","ko":"중고 가구라서 헐값에 샀어요.","zh":"因为是二手家具，所以才以很低的价格买到的。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"중고","meaning":"旧货，二手货","explanation":"중고：旧货，二手货","readings":[{"term":"중고","audio":"/audio/fde026db5a542b587206.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"77274","senseId":"2","lemma":"중고","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"가구라서","meaning":"家具","explanation":"가구：家具；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；라서：名词判断或 아니다 后的原因表达：“因为是、因为不是”。","readings":[{"term":"가구","audio":"/audio/7cd1a55d13c114f1190b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62492","senseId":"1","lemma":"가구","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"헐값에","meaning":"低价，廉价，贱价","explanation":"헐값：低价，廉价，贱价；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"헐값","audio":"/audio/2a7ab851207a44de2191.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"86476","senseId":"1","lemma":"헐값","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"샀어요.","meaning":"买，购买","explanation":"사다：买，购买；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"사다","audio":"/audio/ee0ee072926e06fcb4a4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"49419","senseId":"1","lemma":"사다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"fde026db5a542b58","term":"중고","zh":"旧货，二手货","audio":"/audio/fde026db5a542b587206.mp3","entryId":"77274","definition":"由于已经使用或放置时间较长而变旧的物品。","pronunciation":["중고"]},{"id":"7cd1a55d13c114f1","term":"가구","zh":"家具","audio":"/audio/7cd1a55d13c114f1190b.mp3","entryId":"62492","definition":"家庭用的工具，如床、衣柜、餐桌等。","pronunciation":["가구"]},{"id":"2a7ab851207a44de","term":"헐값","zh":"低价，廉价，贱价","audio":"/audio/2a7ab851207a44de2191.mp3","entryId":"86476","defi